  "body": "\n<article class=\"page-tools-tool\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPage\">\n<!-- ═══ 2. tool hero ═══ -->\n<section class=\"section-sm\" style=\"padding-top:var(--sp-6);padding-bottom:0;position:relative\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n<ol class=\"breadcrumb-list\">\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/\" class=\"bc-home-link\"><span class=\"bc-prompt\">&gt;_</span>Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/tools/\">Tools</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">APK Size Analyzer</span></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"APK Size Analyzer\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/apk-size-analyzer/\"}]}</script>\n<div class=\"about-hero\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-6)\">\n<p class=\"label label-green\">&gt;_ tools --apk-size</p>\n<div class=\"about-intro\">\n<div class=\"about-text\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin:16px 0;letter-spacing:-.03em\">APK Size Analyzer</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.7;max-width:56ch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDrop an .apk and see exactly where the bytes are: dex code, native libs per ABI, res/, assets/, resources.arsc - with bloat flags and trim tips. The APK is read in your browser with zero dependencies (a hand-rolled ZIP + DEFLATE reader); nothing is uploaded.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--leaderboard\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 3. tool behaviour (APK size analyzer) ═══ -->\n<div id=\"apk\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<div class=\"apk-wrap\">\n<section class=\"apk-card\">\n<div class=\"apk-sec\"><span class=\"apk-sdot\"></span><h2>YOUR APK</h2><span class=\"apk-line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"apk-drop\" id=\"apk-drop\" for=\"apk-file\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Choose an APK file to analyze\">\n<span class=\"apk-dropicon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▲</span>\n<span class=\"apk-droptxt\">Drop an .apk here, or tap to choose</span>\n<span class=\"apk-dropsub\">any size - parsed locally, never uploaded</span>\n</label>\n<input type=\"file\" id=\"apk-file\" class=\"apk-fileinput\" accept=\".apk,application/vnd.android.package-archive\" aria-label=\"APK file\">\n<span class=\"apk-filelabel\" id=\"apk-filelabel\"></span>\n<div class=\"apk-err\" id=\"apk-err\" hidden></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"apk-card\" id=\"apk-results\" hidden>\n<div class=\"apk-sec\"><span class=\"apk-sdot\"></span><h2>WHERE THE BYTES ARE</h2><span class=\"apk-line\"></span></div>\n<p class=\"apk-meta\" id=\"apk-meta\"></p>\n<div id=\"apk-summary\"></div>\n<div class=\"apk-sec\"><span class=\"apk-sdot\"></span><h2>NATIVE LIBS PER ABI</h2><span class=\"apk-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"apk-abis\" id=\"apk-abis\"></div>\n<div class=\"apk-sec\"><span class=\"apk-sdot\"></span><h2>BLOAT FLAGS</h2><span class=\"apk-line\"></span></div>\n<div id=\"apk-flags\"></div>\n<div class=\"apk-sec\"><span class=\"apk-sdot\"></span><h2>TRIM TIPS</h2><span class=\"apk-line\"></span></div>\n<ul class=\"apk-tips\" id=\"apk-tips\"></ul>\n<div class=\"apk-sec\"><span class=\"apk-sdot\"></span><h2>TOP 12 LARGEST FILES</h2><span class=\"apk-line\"></span></div>\n<div id=\"apk-top\"></div>\n<p class=\"apk-honest\"><b>Honest scope:</b> this reads ZIP metadata and the binary AndroidManifest - it does not decode resources or dex bytecode. Sizes are uncompressed on-disk sizes, which is what Play reports. A missing manifest read degrades gracefully: the size breakdown still works.</p>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"apk-foot\">no server · no JSZip, no dependencies - a hand-rolled ZIP + DEFLATE reader · your APK never leaves this device</footer>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 4. related tools (6-point law #3) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"apk-related\" aria-labelledby=\"apk-related-h\">\n<h2 id=\"apk-related-h\" class=\"apk-related-h\">&gt;_ Related tools</h2>\n<div class=\"apk-related-grid\">\n<a class=\"apk-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/debug-log-analyzer/\">\n<span class=\"apk-rel-name\">Debug Log Analyzer</span>\n<span class=\"apk-rel-desc\">When the build misbehaves, read the log it left behind.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"apk-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/json-formatter/\">\n<span class=\"apk-rel-name\">JSON Formatter</span>\n<span class=\"apk-rel-desc\">Same zero-dependency inspection for JSON payloads.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"apk-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/sqlite-mysql-converter/\">\n<span class=\"apk-rel-name\">SQLite ⇄ MySQL Converter</span>\n<span class=\"apk-rel-desc\">Migrating the data behind the app, not just the binary.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"apk-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/htaccess-nginx-converter/\">\n<span class=\"apk-rel-name\">.htaccess → Nginx Converter</span>\n<span class=\"apk-rel-desc\">Serving the download? Convert the server rules.</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ═══ 5. visible FAQ (6-point law #2 - mirrors the FAQPage schema byte-exact) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"apk-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"apk-faq-h\">\n<h2 id=\"apk-faq-h\" class=\"apk-faq-h\">&gt;_ FAQ</h2>\n<details class=\"apk-faq-item\">\n<summary>How can I reduce my APK size?</summary>\n<p>Ship an App Bundle so Play strips densities and ABIs per device, enable R8 shrinking with resource shrinking, convert large PNGs to WebP, and remove ABIs you do not need with abiFilters. The analyzer flags each of these when it sees them.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"apk-faq-item\">\n<summary>Does this APK analyzer upload my file?</summary>\n<p>No. The APK is parsed entirely in your browser with a hand-rolled ZIP and DEFLATE reader - there are no dependencies and no network requests. Your app never leaves your device.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"apk-faq-item\">\n<summary>Why is my APK bigger than the size Play reports?</summary>\n<p>A raw APK carries every density bucket and every ABI. Google Play generates device-specific APKs from your App Bundle, so the download each user gets is smaller than the universal APK you test locally.</p>\n</details>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--in-content\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-300x250-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--before-footer\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"